{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22034","headline":"有木诗八首 五 · 白居易","name":"有木诗八首 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有木香苒苒，山头生一蕟。\n主人不知名，移种近轩闼。\n爱其有芳味，因以调麴糵。\n前後曾饮者，十人无一活。\n岂徒悔封植，兼亦误采掇。\n试问识药人，始知名野葛。\n年深已滋蔓，刀斧不可伐。\n何时猛风来，爲我连根拔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22034.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22034","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}